{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15471","headline":"酬丘拱外甥览余旧文见寄 · 李端","name":"酬丘拱外甥览余旧文见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丘迟本才子，始冠即周旋。\n舅乏郄鉴爱，君如衞玠贤。\n礼将金友等，情向玉人偏。\n鄙俗那劳似，龙锺却要怜。\n投甎聊取笑，赠绮一何妍。\n野坐临黄菊，溪行踏绿钱。\n岩高云反下，洞黑水潜穿。\n僻岭猿偷栗，枯池雁唼莲。\n身居霞外寺，思发月明田。\n犹恨萦尘网，昏昏过几年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}